Acceptance criteria:
Either console can be lifted, translated on all three axes and dropped while
its quaternion remains unchanged. Moves avoid occupied positions; releases
fall and settle within the desk workspace. Escape, pointer cancellation,
lost capture, blur and resize safely cancel. Independent moved positions
survive console switching and play/Inspect/table round trips in this session.
Keyboard and touch work; reset is available. Pear-boy and both native cores,
input, screens and saves retain their existing behavior. No push/deployment.

